{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ayurmedi-backend-v1",
    "name": "AyurMedi Backend APIs",
    "description": "Complete Ayurmedi Hospital Management System API Collection - Production Deployed Version\n\n## Modules Included:\n- 🔐 Authentication (Login, Logout, Password Reset)\n- 🏥 Hospital Management\n- 👥 User Management\n- 📋 Patient Registration & Management\n- 📝 Dynamic Forms Engine\n- 🩺 Consultations\n- 📋 Prescriptions\n- 🌿 Panchakarma Treatments\n- 🎫 Token & Queue Management\n- 💰 Billing & Payments\n- 💊 Inventory Management\n- 📊 Reports & Analytics\n- 📈 Dashboard\n\n## Environment Variables Required:\n- `base_url`: https://zxtnpc9yhe.execute-api.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com\n- `auth_token`: JWT token (auto-filled after login)\n- `hospital_id`: Hospital ID (auto-filled after login)\n- `patient_id`: Patient ID (filled during testing)\n- `doctor_id`: Doctor ID (filled during testing)\n- `consultation_id`: Consultation ID (filled during testing)\n- `prescription_id`: Prescription ID (filled during testing)\n- `plan_id`: Panchakarma plan ID (filled during testing)\n- `bill_id`: Bill ID (filled during testing)\n\n## Authentication:\nAll APIs (except login, forgot-password, reset-password) require JWT authentication. Use the login request to obtain the token.\n\n## SRS Compliance:\nAll APIs are compliant with the Ayurmedi SRS v1.0 requirements and support multi-tenant hospital isolation.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Authentication",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  if (res.success && res.data) {",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"auth_token\", res.data.accessToken);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"hospital_id\", res.data.hospitalId || \"GLOBAL\");",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"user_id\", res.data.userId || res.data.sub);",
                  "    pm.environment.set(\"user_role\", res.data.role || \"SUPER_ADMIN\");",
                  "    console.log(\"✅ Login successful - Token saved to environment\");",
                  "  }",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log(\"❌ Login failed:\", res.message);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@ayurmedi.com\",\n  \"password\": \"Admin@2026\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "login"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Authenticate user and return JWT tokens\n\n**SRS Module**: Authentication\n**Required Fields**: email, password\n**Response**: accessToken, refreshToken, userInfo"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", () => {",
                  "  pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Response has success true\", () => {",
                  "  const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(res.success).to.be.true;",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.environment.unset(\"auth_token\");",
                  "  console.log(\"✅ Logged out - Token cleared\");",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/logout",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "auth",
                "logout"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Logout user and invalidate JWT token\n\n**SRS Module**: Authentication\n**Auth Required**: Yes\n**Response**: Success confirmation"
